    "Term_JP": "采配幹部",
    "Term_JPReading": "ディーラーズ",
    "Term_EN": "Dealers",
    "TermType": null,
    "Category": "Role",
    "BodyBlocks_JP": [
      "78人のアルカナホルダーで構成される異能探偵調査団「78特殊探偵団」のすべての能力を統べ、アルカナホルダーの采配を行う特殊幹部。",
      "アルカナに強い知見があり戦闘力も高い人材が適しているとされており、【四元の魔術師】のアルカナホルダー「金田一 卓斗」によって錦野姉妹の２人にこの役職が与えられた。"
    ],
    "BodyBlocks_EN": [
      "Special executives who oversee all abilities of the 78 Special Investigators, a group composed of 78 Arcanaholders, and manage the deployment of Arcanaholders.",
      "It is said that individuals with strong knowledge of Arcana and high combat ability are suitable for this role, and the Arcanaholder 'Tact Kindaichi' of the [Magician of Elements] assigned this position to the two Actressilk sisters."
    ],
